"External Frame Buffer (XFB)" = "External Frame Buffer (外部フレームバッファ)";
"Store XFB Copies to Texture Only" = "Store XFB Copies to Texture Only";
"Immediately Present XFB" = "XFBを即時表示する";
"Skip Presenting Duplicate Frames" = "重複フレームの表示をスキップする";
"Fast Depth Calculation" = "深度の計算を高速に行う";
"Disable Bounding Box" = "Bounding Box を無効にする";
